tance.\n\noverall_soundscape: A deep enclosed resonance surrounds the camera, layered with a fast air rush through the vertical shaft, soft ceramic vibration, and distant water echo far below. Each cobalt wave creates a short harmonic pulse; the rotating inner ring adds a low mechanical hum without speech.\n\nnon_diegetic_music: N/A. The final edit will use a separate project-original instrumental track as the locked master audio.\n",
